  <name>7zrn</name>
  <summary>Native GPUI archive manager powered by 7-Zip and tar</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.ddxtcc">
    <name>ddxtcc</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      7zrn is a native GPUI archive manager for Linux. It browses local files
      and archives in a dual-pane interface and drives the 7-Zip and tar
      command line tools for archive operations.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Dual-pane file and archive browsing</li>
      <li>Create, extract, test, and update 7z and zip archives</li>
      <li>Extract tar, compressed tar, and single stream archives</li>
      <li>Password protected archives</li>
      <li>Inline text, Markdown, image, and syntax-highlighted previews</li>
      <li>Drag and drop between panes</li>
      <li>Six color themes</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
